<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 http://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
    <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>
    <parent>
        <groupId>io.github.captainssingapura-hue.homing.js</groupId>
        <artifactId>homing.js</artifactId>
        <version>LOCAL-SNAPSHOT</version>
    </parent>
    <artifactId>homing-studio-themes</artifactId>
    <description>
        RFC 0065 layer 5, RFC 0066 — the theme implementations the studio and
        workspace bundle ships: eleven themes, each an identity plus its
        provisions of the global palettes (colour, type) and, where it has more
        to say than a palette, per-class overrides on the studio's and the
        workspace's groups. Depends on the bundle (homing-studio-workspace)
        because a theme's word reaches every product's classes; nothing in the
        bundle depends on this module — a downstream that ships its own themes
        (fin-dash) takes layers 1–4 and replaces it.
    </description>
    <properties>
        <maven.compiler.source>21</maven.compiler.source>
        <maven.compiler.target>21</maven.compiler.target>
        <project.build.sourceEncoding>UTF-8</project.build.sourceEncoding>
    </properties>
    <dependencies>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.captainssingapura-hue.homing.js</groupId>
            <artifactId>homing-design-server</artifactId>
            <version>${project.parent.version}</version>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.captainssingapura-hue.homing.js</groupId>
            <artifactId>homing-studio-workspace</artifactId>
            <version>${project.parent.version}</version>
        </dependency>
        <!-- RFC 0066 — the completeness law is a conformance rule; the test calls it. -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.github.captainssingapura-hue.homing.js</groupId>
            <artifactId>homing-conformance-rules</artifactId>
            <version>${project.parent.version}</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.junit.jupiter</groupId>
            <artifactId>junit-jupiter</artifactId>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
    </dependencies>
</project>
